{"version":1,"key":"card:596","content":{"id":596,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"Host 请求头是为了解决在同一个服务器上托管多个服务的问题，这些服务共享同一个 IP 地址（多个域名对应一个 IP 地址），为了确定使用哪个托管的服务提供应答，Host 请求头部应运而生。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3666a4f3-d263-4af6-9992-cf15b702ac04","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"Host 请求头部的语法：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3d7e1bd3-8d56-46e5-a384-b9e93ff33894","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"Host: <host>[\":\"<port>]","collabId":"b1331322-70f0-46b4-ac2c-99eb77be557a","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"944e8281-698a-4611-a792-1591a8efdb84","language":"HTTP","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"85a2db76-31ef-45cb-adff-e4be8789b65e"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"<host>","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是主机名（域名或 IP 地址）","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9a4d3d23-835a-47dd-83e3-e6887ba55d98","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"8505b824-35ee-4c9d-9adb-65ca1c32c49a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"[\":\"<port>]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是可选的端口，一般当端口不是默认端口（80 或 443）的时候才需要单独指定","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a7d0b0c1-8972-4381-be55-01fefc1e868d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"59ed001c-8cd3-4ab4-90fa-9f93da547120","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"c